<title>BELARUS: Belarussian rouble fixed lower at 15,400 per dolla.</title>
<headline>Belarussian rouble fixed lower at 15,400 per dolla.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 15,400 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange, from 14,500.</p>
<p>				    August 30	     August 29</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    15,400		  14,500</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $8.385 million	$2.750 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
